# Suno AI Style Prompt Reconstruction

**Genre:** ${result.genre}
**Vocal Style:** ${result.vocalStyle}
**Instruments:** ${result.instruments}
**Production Style:** ${result.productionStyle}
**Mood:** ${result.mood}
**Tempo:** ${result.tempo}

---
*Generated by SunoReverse v1.0*
      `.trim();

      setState({ loading: false, result, error: null, rawMarkdown: markdown });
    } catch (err: any) {
